---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Refund Policy — AI Crossword Maker"
  description="Refund policy for AI Crossword Maker subscriptions and credit packs, including AI generation failures."
  canonicalPath="/refund-policy/"
>
  <section class="container section prose" style="padding-top:1.5rem;">
    <h1>Refund Policy</h1>
    <p class="muted"><em>Last updated: 2026-11-01.</em></p>

    <h2>Operator</h2>
    <p>
      <strong>Brand / site:</strong> AI Crossword Maker (<code>https://crosswordmaker.app</code>).<br />
      <strong>Operator:</strong> the individual operator of crosswordmaker.app.<br />
      <strong>Billing support:</strong>
      <a href="mailto:support@crosswordmaker.app">support@crosswordmaker.app</a>
    </p>

    <h2>AI generation failures (refundable)</h2>
    <p>
      If a paid AI generation fails because of a service fault (for example the request errors out,
      times out on our side, or otherwise does not deliver a usable generation result after a paid
      entitlement was charged), contact
      <a href="mailto:support@crosswordmaker.app">support@crosswordmaker.app</a>. We will restore the
      consumed credit or refund the related charge for that failed generation. Please include your
      account email, approximate time, and any error details.
    </p>

    <h2>Pro subscriptions</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        Cancel anytime through the payment provider’s customer tools when available, or by emailing
        support. Access continues through the end of the paid period unless we state otherwise.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Change of mind</strong> after a billing period has started: we do not offer a
        pro‑rata cash refund for unused subscription time, except where applicable law requires
        otherwise.
      </li>
      <li>
        Subscription charges tied to documented <strong>AI generation failures</strong> are handled
        under the failure rule above (credit restore or refund of the failed use), not as a full
        period cancellation refund.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Credit Packs / Activity Pack</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Credits consumed by successful generations or successful exports</strong> are
        non-refundable, except where applicable law requires otherwise.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Credits consumed by failed AI generations</strong> (service fault) are restored or
        refunded as described above.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Unused credits</strong> (pack purchased but little or no successful use): email
        support for a case-by-case review. Change-of-mind alone after substantial successful use is
        not a refund ground.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How to request</h2>
    <p>
      Email <a href="mailto:support@crosswordmaker.app">support@crosswordmaker.app</a>. Chargebacks
      and payment disputes also follow Stripe/Creem tooling; contacting us first usually resolves
      generation-failure cases faster.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
